From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shcore: forward the global counter ordinals to shlwapi

shcore's ordinals 130-132 (SHGlobalCounterGetValue, Increment, Decrement by SHGLOBALCOUNTER number) forward to shlwapi's 632-634, which keep the counters (7703); they were spec stubs, so a program importing them from shcore died calling them. 133 (SetValue) stays a stub: a semaphore count cannot be set.
---
--- a/dlls/shcore/shcore.spec
+++ b/dlls/shcore/shcore.spec
@@ -119,9 +119,9 @@
 125 stdcall -noname SHGetValueGoodBootW(long wstr wstr ptr ptr ptr) shcore_SHGetValueGoodBootW
 126 stdcall -noname SHLoadRegUIStringW(long wstr ptr long) shcore_SHLoadRegUIStringW
 127 stub -noname QuerySourceCreateFromKeyEx
-130 stub -noname SHGlobalCounterGetValue
-131 stub -noname SHGlobalCounterIncrement
-132 stub -noname SHGlobalCounterDecrement
+130 stdcall -noname SHGlobalCounterGetValue(long) shlwapi.#632
+131 stdcall -noname SHGlobalCounterIncrement(long) shlwapi.#633
+132 stdcall -noname SHGlobalCounterDecrement(long) shlwapi.#634
 133 stub -noname SHGlobalCounterSetValue
 140 stdcall -noname IUnknown_ProfferService(ptr ptr ptr ptr) shcore_IUnknown_ProfferService
 141 stub -noname IUnknown_RemoveBackReferences
